#: ../../tools/xenbase_tools.rst:61 899fbcc60b89433a8272b8ca5ed0b0aa
msgid "**Name**: ``Xenbase_search_genes``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/xenbase_tools.rst:63 f28cb23ed7b2426ba9d4625e8db84812
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search for Xenopus (frog) genes in Xenbase via the "
"Alliance of Genome Resources API. Returns gene IDs, symbols, names, and "
"species for both Xenopus tropicalis and Xenopus laevis. Xenbase is the "
"primary database for Xenopus genetics and developmental biology. "
"Optionally filter by species (tropicalis or laevis). Useful for finding "
"amphibian homologs of human disease genes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/xenbase_tools.rst:67 fe39a23b50cb4b84ad3f74e4c1bf144c
msgid ""
"``query`` (string) (required) Gene symbol or name to search. Examples: "
"'tp53', 'pax6', 'sox2', 'bmp4', 'wnt3a', 'fgf8'."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/xenbase_tools.rst:70 c9b49f8129f84a489a6f8d6134adca2a
msgid ""
"``species`` (string) (optional) Optional species filter: 'tropicalis' for"
" X. tropicalis, 'laevis' for X. laevis. Leave empty for both species."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/xenbase_tools.rst:73 639b072a7fee433cae95e472404237d3
msgid ""
"``limit`` (integer) (optional) Maximum number of results to return. "
"Default: 10."
msgstr ""

